# Rust build artifacts
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock is committed: Forge ships binaries (forge_cli, forge-runtime), so a
# pinned lockfile is required for reproducible CI builds. Leaving it unpinned
# lets CI resolve incompatible transitive deps (e.g. temporal_rs vs icu_calendar).

